  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"{\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p>Now&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p>For&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is increasing</p><p>For&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo></math>&nbsp; function is decreasing.</p><p>So, at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;there is a point of maxima</p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>For maximum value at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#8805;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>32</mn><mo>&#8805;</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mo>[</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>&#8746;</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>]</mo></math></p></blockquote>"
